    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Count phospho-histone-H3-positive cells in the anterior sixth under blinded labels and compare pseudo groups with wild-type species distributions. The mechanistic extension would require showing that gap-junction disruption, rather than a correlated process, controls the distribution.";
