    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Per-animal counts and raw microscopy files are not clearly deposited.", "The experiment establishes association more strongly than mechanism.";
